WEBVTT

00:09.137 --> 00:10.137
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.172 --> 00:12.103
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.206 --> 00:13.482
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.586 --> 00:15.586
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.689 --> 00:18.206
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:18.310 --> 00:20.344
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.448 --> 00:22.206
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:22.310 --> 00:24.827
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:24.931 --> 00:26.310
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:26.413 --> 00:28.655
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:28.758 --> 00:30.068
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:30.172 --> 00:32.655
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:32.758 --> 00:34.310
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:34.413 --> 00:36.344
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:36.448 --> 00:39.344
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.448 --> 00:40.448
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.482 --> 00:43.068
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:45.379 --> 00:48.965
Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
字幕由 THE 赞助
美国教育部

00:49.068 --> 00:52.000
and NICKELODEON
和尼克国际儿童频道

01:02.689 --> 01:03.965
We now return
我们现在返回

01:04.068 --> 01:07.655
to tonight's Creepy-Time
Theaterpresentation
到今晚的恐怖时间
戏剧表演

01:07.758 --> 01:09.379
of "Night of the Robot."
《机器人之夜》。

01:12.896 --> 01:16.517
Hurry, Gary,
the scary robot movie's on.
快点，加里，
恐怖的机器人电影正在上映。

01:17.896 --> 01:19.896
What do you mean
I shouldn't watch this?
你是什么意思
我不应该看这个吗？

01:20.000 --> 01:22.689
Scary movies don't always
freak me out.
恐怖电影并不总是
吓死我了。

01:25.413 --> 01:27.448
What if Mom is a robot?
如果妈妈是机器人怎么办？

01:27.551 --> 01:29.655
What if Uncle Sherm is a robot?
如果谢姆叔叔是机器人怎么办？

01:29.758 --> 01:33.172
What if Gary is a robot?
如果加里是机器人怎么办？

01:33.275 --> 01:34.275
Gary?
加里？

01:35.344 --> 01:37.620
Psst, Gary?
嘘，加​​里？

01:37.724 --> 01:39.344
Gare-bear?
车站熊？

01:41.000 --> 01:44.758
Gary, if you were a robot,
you'd tell me, right?
加里，如果你是一个机器人，
你会告诉我的，对吗？

01:46.448 --> 01:48.172
Oh, I got nothing
to worry about.
哦，我什么都没有
担心。

01:48.275 --> 01:51.482
And now to get
a good night's sleep.
现在要得到
睡个好觉。

02:07.310 --> 02:09.000
Robot! Oh, my gosh!
机器人！哦，天哪！

02:11.379 --> 02:12.413
Huh?
啊？

02:14.586 --> 02:15.724
How about a little music
来点音乐怎么样

02:15.827 --> 02:17.310
to count me money to?
来数我钱去？

02:17.413 --> 02:20.724
And now for the number-one
song in Bikini Bottom,
现在来说说第一名
比基尼泳裤中的歌曲，

02:20.827 --> 02:21.896
"Electric Zoo."
“电动动物园。”

02:24.000 --> 02:25.793
Hey, that's pretty catchy!
嘿，这真是太吸引人了！

02:25.896 --> 02:29.724
♪ Bee-bee-boo-bop,
bee-bee-boo-beep. ♪
♪ 蜜蜂-蜜蜂-boo-bop，
嘟嘟嘟。 ♪

02:29.827 --> 02:30.827
Yeah, that's not bad.
是的，那还不错。

02:30.931 --> 02:34.275
I love this
young people's music.
我喜欢这个
年轻人的音乐。

02:36.517 --> 02:37.655
I surrender!
我投降！

02:37.758 --> 02:39.137
Oh.SQUIDWARD:
SpongeBob!
哦，章鱼哥：
海绵宝宝！

02:42.068 --> 02:44.724
Squidward, why are
you wearing my hat
on your nose?
章鱼哥，为什么
你戴着我的帽子
在你的鼻子上吗？

02:44.827 --> 02:49.000
I'm not; I'm waiting
for number 17's order!
我不是；我在等
17号的订单！

02:49.103 --> 02:52.620
Number 17... Krabby Patty
and a medium beverage.
17 号...蟹黄派蒂
和一杯中杯饮料。

02:52.724 --> 02:54.137
Of course.
当然。

02:54.241 --> 02:55.493
Sorry, Squidward, I'm
not really feeling
myself today.
对不起，章鱼哥，我
不太感觉
今天我自己。

02:55.517 --> 02:58.137
I keep thinking robots
are taking over the world...
我一直在思考机器人
正在接管世界...

02:58.241 --> 02:59.931
Probably because
I watched this movie
大概是因为
我看了这部电影

03:00.034 --> 03:01.793
where robots take over
the world.
机器人接管的地方
世界。

03:01.896 --> 03:03.896
I even asked Gary
if he was a robot.
我什至问过加里
如果他是一个机器人。

03:04.000 --> 03:05.103
Pretty funny, huh?
很有趣，是吧？

03:05.206 --> 03:05.965
Hilarious.
搞笑。

03:06.068 --> 03:08.758
Just deliver the food.
只要把食物送过来就可以了。

03:08.862 --> 03:10.137
There you go.
就这样吧。

03:10.241 --> 03:11.137
Enjoy your...
享受你的...

03:11.241 --> 03:13.241
Say, you're not
a robot, are you?
说吧，你不是
机器人，你是吗？

03:13.344 --> 03:14.758
No. I'm not.
不，我不是。

03:14.862 --> 03:17.758
Well, keep your eyes peeled.
好吧，请擦亮眼睛。

03:17.862 --> 03:19.241
They're everywhere.
他们无处不在。

03:19.344 --> 03:21.172
Back to work!
回去工作吧！

03:21.896 --> 03:25.586
I feel completely recharged.
我感觉自己完全充电了。

03:25.689 --> 03:27.758
That sounds
like Mr. Krabs.
听起来
就像蟹老板一样。

03:28.379 --> 03:32.137
Come on, little buddy,
play it again, please?
来吧，小伙伴，
请再玩一次好吗？

03:32.241 --> 03:33.620
One more time,
再一次，

03:33.724 --> 03:35.172
for me.
为我。

03:35.275 --> 03:36.172
That was strange.
这很奇怪。

03:36.275 --> 03:38.724
Mr. Krabs was talking
to his radio
蟹老板正在讲话
到他的收音机

03:38.827 --> 03:41.000
and he said
he feels "recharged."
他说
他感觉自己“充电了”。

03:41.103 --> 03:44.413
If I didn't know better,
I'd say he was...
如果我不知道的话
我想说他是...

03:44.517 --> 03:46.344
a robot!
一个机器人！

03:46.448 --> 03:47.620
Nah.
不。

03:47.724 --> 03:49.068
Yes, hello.
是的，你好。

03:49.172 --> 03:51.758
I was wondering if you
could play that song again.
我想知道你是否
可以再次播放那首歌。

03:51.862 --> 03:53.137
Hmm, which one, man?
嗯，哪一个，伙计？

03:53.241 --> 03:56.310
The one that goes
"Bee-boo-boo-bop,
boo-boo-beep."
那个走的
“蜜蜂、蜜蜂、蜜蜂、
嘘——嘘——哔。”

03:56.413 --> 03:59.931
No, man, you're thinking of
"Bee-boo-boo-bop, boo-boo-bop."
不，伙计，你在想
“噗噗噗，噗噗噗。”

04:00.034 --> 04:02.689
Bee-bee-boo, boo-boo-bop?
毕毕毕，毕毕毕，毕毕毕毕？

04:02.793 --> 04:04.793
Bee-boo-boo-bop?
蜜蜂-boo-boo-bop？

04:04.896 --> 04:06.517
Boo-boo-bee-bop?
嘘-嘘-比-波普？

04:06.620 --> 04:09.137
Not "Bee-boo-boo-beep"?
不是“哔哔哔”吗？

04:09.241 --> 04:10.586
Bop?
波普？

04:10.689 --> 04:11.724
Beep?!
嘟？！

04:11.827 --> 04:12.827
Boo-boo-bop?!
噗噗噗？！

04:15.413 --> 04:16.551
Oh, my gosh!
哦，天哪！

04:16.655 --> 04:19.655
Why was Mr. Krabs making
all those beeping sounds?
蟹老板为什么要做
所有这些嘟嘟声？

04:19.758 --> 04:23.413
Could it be that he's a robot?
难道他是机器人？

04:23.517 --> 04:24.965
Nah.
不。

04:33.000 --> 04:35.758
Oh, Squidward, it's terrible!
哦，章鱼哥，太可怕了！

04:35.862 --> 04:38.896
Mr. Krabs...
talking to radio...
蟹老板...
与广播交谈...

04:39.000 --> 04:42.172
beeping sounds...
strange dancing...
嘟嘟的声音...
奇怪的舞蹈...

04:42.275 --> 04:43.000
robot!
机器人！

04:43.103 --> 04:44.448
That's great, SpongeBob.
太棒了，海绵宝宝。

04:44.551 --> 04:48.793
Why don't you work
on this problem back
in the kitchen!
你为什么不工作
关于这个问题
在厨房里！

04:49.965 --> 04:51.448
I'm serious, Squidward.
我是认真的，章鱼哥。

04:51.551 --> 04:52.620
Mr. Krabs is a robot.
蟹老板是一个机器人。

04:52.724 --> 04:53.862
And I can prove it, too!
我也可以证明这一点！

04:53.965 --> 04:54.758
How did you...?
你怎么...?

04:54.862 --> 04:55.965
Let's see... in the movie,
让我们看看电影中，

04:56.068 --> 04:58.000
the robots didn't have
a sense of humor;
机器人没有
幽默感；

04:58.103 --> 04:59.379
they couldn't laugh.
他们笑不出来。

04:59.482 --> 05:00.724
Hey, Mr. Krabs!
嘿，蟹老板！

05:00.827 --> 05:01.965
What is it, boy?
这是什么，男孩？

05:02.068 --> 05:03.355
Squidward just told me
a hilarious joke
章鱼哥刚刚告诉我
一个搞笑的笑话

05:03.379 --> 05:05.896
and I thought you
might like to hear it.
我以为你
可能会喜欢听。

05:06.000 --> 05:07.379
Is it true, Squidward?
这是真的吗，章鱼哥？

05:07.482 --> 05:08.517
Is it hilarious?
好笑吗？

05:08.620 --> 05:10.827
Um... yeah, sure.
嗯...是的，当然。

05:10.931 --> 05:12.517
Well, let's hear it, lad.
好吧，让我们听听吧，小伙子。

05:12.620 --> 05:13.896
Okay, here it goes.
好的，就这样吧。

05:14.000 --> 05:15.080
Uh, how'd it go, Squidward?
呃，怎么样，章鱼哥？

05:16.448 --> 05:19.068
It went... um, uh,
let's see, uh...
它去了……嗯，呃，
让我们看看，呃...

05:19.172 --> 05:23.103
Why couldn't the 11-year-old
get into the pirate movie?
为什么11岁的孩子就不能
进入海盗电影？

05:23.206 --> 05:23.793
Why?
为什么？

05:23.896 --> 05:25.931
It was rated "Arr!"
它被评为“啊！”

05:30.655 --> 05:31.655
Arr!
啊！

05:32.827 --> 05:36.413
Because it's...
about... pirates.
因为它是...
关于……海盗。

05:36.517 --> 05:39.482
I'm not paying you to do
stand-up, Mr. Squidward.
我不会付钱给你做
站起来，章鱼哥先生。

05:39.586 --> 05:40.758
Now, get back to work.
现在，回去工作吧。

05:41.896 --> 05:43.275
Not even a chuckle!
连笑声都没有！

05:43.379 --> 05:44.379
See, Squidward?
看到了吗，章鱼哥？

05:44.448 --> 05:47.448
He didn't laugh because
he couldn't laugh
他没有笑，因为
他笑不出来

05:47.551 --> 05:49.137
because he's a robot!
因为他是机器人！

05:49.241 --> 05:52.827
There's a logical explanation
why he didn't laugh, SpongeBob.
有一个合乎逻辑的解释
为什么他不笑，海绵宝宝。

05:52.931 --> 05:54.379
He's obviously heard it before.
他显然以前听过。

05:54.482 --> 05:56.413
The only reason
you think Krabs
is a robot
唯一的原因
你以为蟹蟹
是一个机器人

05:56.517 --> 05:58.793
is because you watched
that stupid movie.
是因为你看了
那部愚蠢的电影。

05:58.896 --> 05:59.931
Now, why don't you...
现在，你为什么不...

06:00.034 --> 06:01.172
Hey, Mr. Krabs!
嘿，蟹老板！

06:01.275 --> 06:03.000
What?
What is it, boy?
什么？
这是什么，男孩？

06:03.103 --> 06:07.000
Squidward's father
never hugged him.
章鱼哥的父亲
从来没有拥抱过他。

06:07.103 --> 06:08.551
Isn't that sad?
这不是很悲伤吗？

06:09.965 --> 06:11.344
Yes, I suppose
that is rather sad.
是的，我想
这是相当可悲的。

06:11.448 --> 06:14.482
But Squidward
can hug himself
during his break.
但是章鱼哥
可以拥抱自己
在他休息期间。

06:14.586 --> 06:16.172
Now, get back to work.
现在，回去工作吧。

06:16.275 --> 06:18.251
Just like the robot in the
movie... he couldn't cry either.
就像里面的机器人一样
电影……他也哭不出来。

06:18.275 --> 06:20.000
SpongeBob,
this is getting ridiculous.
海绵宝宝，
这真是太荒谬了。

06:20.103 --> 06:22.379
I'll have you know
my father loved me very much!
我会让你知道
我的父亲非常爱我！

06:22.482 --> 06:26.655
That's the final test,
Squidward... the love test.
这就是最后的考验了
章鱼哥……爱情测试。

06:26.758 --> 06:27.896
Robots can't love.
机器人不能爱。

06:28.000 --> 06:29.724
Now, wait, SpongeBob...
现在，等等，海绵宝宝……

06:29.827 --> 06:30.620
Hey, Mr. Krabs!
嘿，蟹老板！

06:30.724 --> 06:32.068
What is it, SpongeBob?
这是什么，海绵宝宝？

06:32.172 --> 06:35.689
I just wanted to tell you
that Squidward loves you!
我只是想告诉你
章鱼哥爱你！

06:36.172 --> 06:37.965
Get back to work,
Mr. Squidward.
回去工作吧，
章鱼哥先生。

06:40.000 --> 06:41.000
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

06:46.137 --> 06:48.241
Aw, me radio died.
噢，我的收音机坏了。

06:48.344 --> 06:51.517
Mmm... these batteries still
have a little juice in them.
嗯...这些电池仍然
里面有一点汁液。

06:51.620 --> 06:55.068
I know... I'll give them
to Pearl for Christmas.
我知道...我会给他们
去珍珠岛过圣诞节。

06:57.034 --> 06:59.620
Me hard-boiled egg is ready!
我的水煮蛋就做好了！

06:59.724 --> 07:01.793
I can already taste it.
我已经能尝到了。

07:01.896 --> 07:03.551
Come to Papa!
来爸爸身边吧！

07:03.655 --> 07:05.172
Gotcha!
明白了！

07:05.275 --> 07:08.103
And what good is a hard-boiled
egg without a little salt?
煮熟的有什么好处
鸡蛋不加一点盐可以吗？

07:08.206 --> 07:10.965
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

07:12.551 --> 07:14.241
Oh, my eyes! Aah!
哦，我的眼睛！啊啊！

07:14.344 --> 07:14.965
Mister...
先生...

07:15.068 --> 07:16.275
Will you be quiet?
你会安静吗？

07:16.379 --> 07:18.206
What did these robots
in the movie look like?
这些机器人做了什么
电影里的样子？

07:18.310 --> 07:21.000
They had piercing red eyes,
metal pincers for hands
他们有一双锐利的红色眼睛，
手用金属钳子

07:21.103 --> 07:22.379
and they ran on batteries.
它们靠电池运行。

07:22.482 --> 07:27.137
Okay, so tell me, does Mr. Krabs
look anything like that?!
好吧，请告诉我，蟹老板是吗？
看起来像那样吗？

07:40.551 --> 07:43.103
I'll evacuate
the customers,
you call the Navy.
我会撤离
客户，
你打电话给海军。

07:43.206 --> 07:45.137
Hello, operator,
get me the Navy.
您好，接线员，
给我海军。

07:45.241 --> 07:49.965
Hello, you've reached the Navy's
automated phone service.
您好，您已到达海军
自动电话服务。

07:50.068 --> 07:53.000
Squidward, the robots
are running the Navy!
章鱼哥、机器人
正在管理海军！

07:53.103 --> 07:54.655
Not the Navy!
不是海军！

07:54.758 --> 07:57.241
Everyone, run for your lives!
大家，为自己的生命而奔跑吧！

07:57.344 --> 08:00.206
Robots have taken over
the world!
机器人已经接管了
世界！

08:01.103 --> 08:02.103
Our world!
我们的世界！

08:07.241 --> 08:08.448
What do we do now?
我们现在做什么？

08:08.551 --> 08:09.551
I don't know.
我不知道。

08:09.758 --> 08:10.758
Hey, a nickel!
嘿，五分钱！

08:10.862 --> 08:11.862
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

08:11.896 --> 08:12.758
Sorry.
对不起。

08:12.862 --> 08:14.448
Ah, that's better.
啊，这样好多了。

08:14.551 --> 08:17.758
♪ Bee, boo-boo-bee-boop,
boo-boo-bop... ♪
♪ 蜜蜂，嘘嘘嘘嘘，
呜呜呜……♪

08:17.862 --> 08:19.275
We need to find out
我们需要找出答案

08:19.379 --> 08:21.482
what that robot did with
the real Mr. Krabs, but how?
那个机器人做了什么
真正的蟹老板，但是怎么样呢？

08:21.586 --> 08:24.896
Well, in the movie the hero
teams up with a buddy
嗯，电影里的英雄
与好友组队

08:25.000 --> 08:27.034
and they get the poop
on the robot.
他们得到了便便
在机器人上。

08:27.137 --> 08:29.241
They poop on the robot?
他们在机器人身上拉屎？

08:29.344 --> 08:31.482
Yeah, you know, they get
the straight poop,
是的，你知道，他们得到
笔直的便便，

08:31.586 --> 08:33.137
ask questions, get information.
提出问题，获取信息。

08:33.241 --> 08:35.517
I never thought I'd say this,
我从没想过我会说出这样的话

08:35.620 --> 08:39.655
but, SpongeBob,
let's get that poop!
但是，海绵宝宝，
让我们把粪便弄出来吧！

08:47.896 --> 08:49.413
Oh, hello, boys.
哦，你们好，孩子们。

08:49.862 --> 08:50.862
What can I do for you?
我能为你做什么？

08:51.931 --> 08:54.241
Why did you lock the door?
你为什么锁门？

08:54.344 --> 08:56.517
Why do you have that rope?
你为什么有那根绳子？

08:56.620 --> 08:59.241
Who's watching
the cash register?!
谁在看
收银机？！

09:02.275 --> 09:03.517
SpongeBob! Squidward!
海绵宝宝！章鱼哥！

09:03.620 --> 09:05.689
What's the meaning of this?
这有什么意义呢？

09:05.793 --> 09:07.620
Untie me this instant!
赶紧给我解开！

09:07.724 --> 09:08.724
Shut up.
住口。

09:09.655 --> 09:10.896
Sweet Davy Jones!
可爱的戴维·琼斯！

09:11.000 --> 09:12.482
What the heck is going on?
到底是怎么回事？

09:12.586 --> 09:16.000
I said shut up,
you bucket of bolts!
我说闭嘴，
你这桶螺栓！

09:16.103 --> 09:17.482
I can't take it!
我受不了！

09:18.793 --> 09:20.413
SpongeBob, are you okay?
海绵宝宝，你还好吗？

09:20.517 --> 09:24.344
Oh, Squidward, seeing you
slap Mr. Krabs like that
哦，章鱼哥，见到你了
像那样打蟹老板一巴掌

09:24.448 --> 09:26.241
is just too horrible to watch.
实在是太可怕了。

09:26.344 --> 09:29.172
No, that's
not Mr. Krabs.
不，那是
不是蟹老板。

09:29.275 --> 09:31.379
That's Robot Krabs.
那是机器人螃蟹。

09:31.482 --> 09:32.586
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

09:32.689 --> 09:35.068
And the only way
to deal with these
robot types
并且唯一的办法
来处理这些
机器人类型

09:35.172 --> 09:37.310
is to find out what they know.
就是要找出他们所知道的。

09:37.413 --> 09:39.862
Right.
正确的。

09:40.241 --> 09:43.103
SpongeBob, you
got to ask him
a question first.
海绵宝宝你
得问他
先问个问题。

09:43.206 --> 09:44.068
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

09:44.172 --> 09:46.379
What color is my underwear?
我的内衣是什么颜色的？

09:46.482 --> 09:47.137
SpongeBob,
海绵宝宝，

09:47.241 --> 09:48.310
let me handle this.
让我来处理这件事。

09:48.413 --> 09:49.310
Where's Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板在哪里？

09:49.413 --> 09:52.068
What are you talking about?
你在说什么？

09:52.172 --> 09:53.482
I'm Mr. Krabs.
我是蟹老板。

09:53.586 --> 09:56.000
We can do this
all night if
you want.
我们可以做到这一点
整夜如果
你想要的。

09:56.103 --> 09:57.724
Where's Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板在哪里？

09:57.827 --> 09:59.103
I'm Mr. Krabs.
我是蟹老板。

09:59.206 --> 10:00.862
Where's Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板在哪里？

10:00.965 --> 10:02.172
I'm Mr. Krabs.
我是蟹老板。

10:02.275 --> 10:03.827
Where's Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板在哪里？

10:03.931 --> 10:06.034
I am Mr. Krabs!
我是蟹老板！

10:06.137 --> 10:09.103
I am! I am! I am! I am!
I am! I am! I am!
我是！我是！我是！我是！
我是！我是！我是！

10:09.206 --> 10:11.413
This is one stubborn robot.
这是一个顽固的机器人。

10:11.517 --> 10:13.103
What?!
什么？！

10:13.206 --> 10:16.103
You think I'm a robot?!
你以为我是机器人？！

10:16.206 --> 10:18.448
We don't think;
we know.
我们不认为；
我们知道。

10:18.551 --> 10:21.241
That's the silliest thing
I've ever heard.
这是最愚蠢的事
我曾经听说过。

10:21.344 --> 10:24.000
I am Mr. Krabs!
我是蟹老板！

10:24.103 --> 10:25.137
He's not cracking.
他没有崩溃。

10:25.241 --> 10:27.068
We'll never get it
out of him this way.
我们永远得不到
这样就从他身上出来了。

10:27.172 --> 10:28.172
I got an idea.
我有一个主意。

10:28.206 --> 10:29.586
Keep an eye on him, Squidward.
留意他，章鱼哥。

10:29.689 --> 10:33.241
Don't fall for any
of his robo-tricks.
不要迷恋任何一个
他的机器人技巧。

10:35.551 --> 10:39.034
If Robot Krabs won't tell us
where Mr. Krabs is,
如果蟹蟹机器人不告诉我们
where Mr. Krabs is,

10:39.137 --> 10:42.206
maybe one of his
little robot friends will.
也许是他的其中之一
小机器人朋友们会的。

10:42.310 --> 10:44.000
SpongeBob, uh, that's a blender.
海绵宝宝，呃，那是一个搅拌机。

10:44.103 --> 10:48.241
Yeah, but I saw Mr. Krabs
talking with his radio before.
是的，但我看到了蟹老板
之前用他的收音机说话。

10:48.344 --> 10:50.068
He called it his
"little buddy."
他称其为他的
“小伙伴。”

10:50.172 --> 10:51.068
Oh, really?
哦真的吗？

10:51.172 --> 10:52.389
Put it on the table, SpongeBob.
把它放在桌子上，海绵宝宝。

10:52.413 --> 10:55.517
You're going
to interrogate
my blender?
你要去
审问
我的搅拌机？

10:55.620 --> 10:57.000
You're crazy!
你疯了！

10:57.103 --> 11:01.137
We're just going
to see what your
"little buddy" knows.
我们正要去
看看你的
“小伙伴”知道。

11:01.241 --> 11:02.379
No, wait!
不，等等！

11:02.482 --> 11:04.241
What are you going to do
to me blender?!
你要做什么
给我搅拌机？！

11:04.344 --> 11:05.344
That cost me money!
那花了我钱！

11:05.413 --> 11:07.620
Where's Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板在哪里？

11:09.379 --> 11:10.517
Not talking, eh?
不说话，嗯？

11:12.379 --> 11:17.034
No! That cost me $24.95!
不！那花了我 24.95 美元！

11:17.137 --> 11:19.275
I guess it didn't know anything.
我猜它什么都不知道。

11:19.379 --> 11:21.758
Go get the toaster.
去拿烤面包机。

11:21.862 --> 11:24.000
No, not me toaster.
不，不是我的烤面包机。

11:24.103 --> 11:27.000
That cost me $32.50!
那花了我 32.50 美元！

11:28.793 --> 11:31.413
$62.67!
62.67 美元！

11:32.931 --> 11:34.103
Fort...
堡...

11:34.206 --> 11:35.965
Well, actually,
that one was a gift.
嗯，实际上，
那是一份礼物。

11:36.655 --> 11:39.275
No!
不！

11:39.379 --> 11:41.758
This is the last robot,
Squidward.
这是最后一个机器人，
章鱼哥。

11:41.862 --> 11:44.689
No! Not my cash register!
不！不是我的收银机！

11:44.793 --> 11:45.896
I raised it myself!
我自己养的！

11:46.000 --> 11:49.413
I got it when it was
just a little calculator.
我当时就收到了
只是一个小计算器。

11:49.517 --> 11:51.206
No!
不！

11:55.344 --> 11:58.344
I thought you said
robots can't cry.
我以为你说
机器人不能哭。

11:58.448 --> 12:00.206
I also said they couldn't love.
我还说他们不能爱。

12:00.310 --> 12:03.655
I loved it like it was me own!
我喜欢它，就像它是我自己的一样！

12:03.758 --> 12:06.034
Ah... at least
he's not laughing.
啊……至少
他没有笑。

12:06.137 --> 12:12.172
Oh, I remember the laughs
we used to share...
哦，我记得那些笑声
我们曾经分享...

12:12.275 --> 12:16.724
SpongeBob, how
did that movie
of yours end?
海绵宝宝，怎么样
拍了那部电影
你的结局？

12:16.827 --> 12:17.655
The movie?
电影？

12:17.758 --> 12:19.275
Oh, yeah, the ending was great!
哦，是啊，结局很棒！

12:19.379 --> 12:21.655
Turns out there weren't
any robots after all.
原来没有
毕竟有机器人。

12:21.758 --> 12:25.172
It was just their...
imagination.
这只是他们的...
想象力。

12:26.379 --> 12:28.310
Hey, it's time to feed Gary.
嘿，是时候喂加里了。

12:37.413 --> 12:40.000
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

12:55.103 --> 12:57.620
Gary, the paper's here!
加里，报纸来了！

12:59.275 --> 13:00.620
You can have this, buddy,
你可以拥有这个，伙计，

13:00.724 --> 13:04.620
because all I need is
the "entertainment section."
因为我需要的是
“娱乐区”。

13:10.172 --> 13:11.517
I am a happy sponge!
我是一块快乐的海绵！

13:20.931 --> 13:23.517
I see you got the paper.
我看到你拿到了那张纸。

13:23.620 --> 13:26.241
Oh, hey, Patrick.
哦，嘿，帕特里克。

13:28.724 --> 13:30.413
Well, I better get going.
好吧，我最好走了。

13:30.517 --> 13:32.137
Yep, see you later.
是的，稍后见。

13:33.275 --> 13:34.448
Cheep-cheep-cheep.
吱吱吱。

13:34.551 --> 13:36.482
What did you say?
你说什么？

13:36.586 --> 13:37.586
I didn't say anything.
我什么也没说。

13:37.655 --> 13:38.931
I didn't say anything either.
我也没说什么。

13:39.034 --> 13:40.586
See you later, then.
那么稍后见。

13:40.689 --> 13:41.793
Cheep-cheep-cheep.
吱吱吱。

13:41.896 --> 13:43.517
All right, quit messing with me.
好吧，别再惹我了。

13:43.620 --> 13:45.103
I know you said something.
我知道你说了些什么。

13:45.206 --> 13:46.206
Ah, but it is you
啊，但是是你啊

13:46.275 --> 13:47.724
that is messing with me.
这让我很烦恼。

13:47.827 --> 13:49.206
Cheep-cheep-cheep.
吱吱吱。

13:49.310 --> 13:51.517
That's what's messing with us.
这就是困扰我们的事情。

13:51.620 --> 13:54.517
It's a baby scallop.
这是一个扇贝宝宝。

13:54.620 --> 13:55.620
I'll take care of this.
我会处理这件事。

13:55.689 --> 13:56.482
No, Patrick.
不，帕特里克。

13:56.586 --> 13:57.827
It's totally helpless.
完全是无奈之举。

13:57.931 --> 14:00.620
It looks like
he can't even fly yet.
看起来像
他甚至还不会飞。

14:00.724 --> 14:02.517
Well, what's the matter?
嗯，怎么了？

14:02.620 --> 14:03.620
Is he stupid?
他是傻子吗？

14:03.655 --> 14:05.137
No, Patrick, he's just a baby.
不，帕特里克，他只是个婴儿。

14:05.241 --> 14:07.724
He's all alone
with no one to
take care of him.
他孤身一人
没有人
照顾他。

14:07.827 --> 14:10.379
Well, we can't just
leave him out here.
好吧，我们不能只是
把他留在这儿。

14:10.482 --> 14:11.827
You're right.
你说得对。

14:11.931 --> 14:14.655
Come on, let's
take him into
the pineapple.
来吧，我们
带他进入
菠萝。

14:14.758 --> 14:17.931
Let's see, we need a box
for him to sleep in.
让我们看看，我们需要一个盒子
供他睡觉。

14:18.034 --> 14:19.793
There you go.
就这样吧。

14:19.896 --> 14:22.482
It's the best seat in the house.
这是家里最好的座位。

14:24.241 --> 14:25.137
Let me see.
让我看看。

14:25.241 --> 14:27.827
Hey, it's kind of cute.
嘿，有点可爱。

14:27.931 --> 14:29.206
Uh-oh!
呃-哦！

14:29.310 --> 14:32.137
I think somebody's hungry!
我想有人饿了！

14:32.241 --> 14:32.724
Is it true?
这是真的吗？

14:32.827 --> 14:33.551
Are you hungry?
你饿了吗？

14:33.655 --> 14:35.137
Cheep-cheep-cheep-cheep!
吱吱吱！

14:35.241 --> 14:36.586
I've got just the thing.
我正好有这个东西。

14:36.689 --> 14:38.620
How would you like
a Krabby Patty?
你想要怎样
蟹肉饼？

14:40.000 --> 14:42.172
SpongeBob
SquarePants,
are you crazy?
海绵宝宝
方裤，
你疯了吗？

14:42.275 --> 14:43.620
That's not the right food
这不是正确的食物

14:43.724 --> 14:45.586
for a little fellow like him.
对于像他这样的小人物来说。

14:45.689 --> 14:46.724
Of course not.
当然不是。

14:46.827 --> 14:48.620
I don't know
what I was thinking.
我不知道
我在想什么。

14:48.724 --> 14:50.655
He needs a tiny Krabby Patty.
他需要一个小蟹肉饼。

14:52.068 --> 14:52.965
Bleah!
哎呀！

14:53.068 --> 14:54.206
Huh?
啊？

14:54.310 --> 14:57.551
No one's ever turned down
one of these down before.
没有人曾拒绝过
其中之一之前已被删除。

14:57.655 --> 14:59.103
Let's try a doughnut.
我们来尝尝甜甜圈吧。

15:00.517 --> 15:01.586
French fries?
炸薯条？

15:01.689 --> 15:02.586
Uh-uh.
呃呃。

15:02.689 --> 15:03.689
A doughnut?
甜甜圈？

15:04.758 --> 15:05.758
All we have left
我们只剩下一切

15:05.827 --> 15:06.620
is this apple.
是这个苹果。

15:06.724 --> 15:09.068
Hello, sea creatures!
你好，海洋生物！

15:09.172 --> 15:12.758
I bring you greetings
from Apple World.
我给你带来问候
来自苹果世界。

15:14.482 --> 15:15.310
Of course.
当然。

15:15.413 --> 15:17.620
Scallops love worms.
扇贝喜欢蠕虫。

15:17.724 --> 15:18.896
Huh? Wait!
啊？等待！

15:19.000 --> 15:20.448
We will bury you!
我们会埋葬你的！

15:22.931 --> 15:25.310
Well, you should be good
for the rest...
嗯，你应该很好
对于其余的...

15:26.689 --> 15:27.586
What now?
现在怎么办？

15:27.689 --> 15:28.689
I don't know!
我不知道！

15:30.413 --> 15:31.655
Aw, don't cry!
哎呀，别哭！

15:33.310 --> 15:34.689
Do something, SpongeBob!
做点什么吧，海绵宝宝！

15:34.793 --> 15:37.241
Uh... uh... uh...
呃……呃……呃……

15:37.344 --> 15:39.965
Blah-blah-blah,
look at the funny face!
巴拉巴拉巴拉，
看看那张滑稽的脸！

15:40.068 --> 15:43.620
Doo, doo-doo, doo-doo,
look at the funny face!
Doo, doo-doo, doo-doo,
看看那张滑稽的脸！

15:43.724 --> 15:47.034
Look at the funny face.
看看那张滑稽的脸。

15:47.137 --> 15:48.000
Wait!
等待！

15:48.103 --> 15:50.724
I think I might
know the problem.
我想我可能
知道问题所在。

15:50.827 --> 15:53.482
Yep, that's it all right.
是的，就这样吧。

15:53.586 --> 15:55.758
Hold on just one second.
请坚持一秒钟。

15:55.862 --> 15:58.206
Here he is, good as new.
他就在这里，完好无损。

15:59.482 --> 16:01.241
How did you know?
你怎么知道的？

16:01.344 --> 16:03.620
How do you think?
你觉得怎么样？

16:03.724 --> 16:06.827
And I been doing it
all by myself
我一直在这样做
全部由我自己

16:06.931 --> 16:08.448
for almost a year.
将近一年了。

16:08.551 --> 16:10.482
Wow, I'm sure glad you're here.
哇，我很高兴你在这里。

16:10.586 --> 16:12.172
I know, good thing
there's two of us.
我知道，好事
我们有两个人。

16:12.275 --> 16:16.103
You know, Patrick,
since this scallop
doesn't have parents,
你知道，帕特里克，
自从这个扇贝
没有父母，

16:16.206 --> 16:17.862
we should raise it ourselves.
我们应该自己提出。

16:17.965 --> 16:20.413
Yeah, at least
till it's old enough
是的，至少
直到它足够老

16:20.517 --> 16:21.413
to be on its own.
靠自己。

16:21.517 --> 16:23.034
Oh, I want to be the mom!
哦，我想当妈妈！

16:23.137 --> 16:26.586
I don't think you can be the mom
because you never wear a shirt.
我不认为你能成为妈妈
因为你从不穿衬衫。

16:26.689 --> 16:28.034
You're right.
你说得对。

16:28.137 --> 16:33.275
If I was a mom, this
would be kind of shocking.
如果我是妈妈，这
会有点令人震惊。

16:33.379 --> 16:36.551
Just call me "Daddy"!
就叫我“爸爸”吧！

17:17.172 --> 17:19.827
It sure is cute
when it's asleep.
确实很可爱
当它睡着的时候。

17:19.931 --> 17:20.931
Yeah.
是的。

17:23.862 --> 17:26.172
Shh!
嘘！

17:29.379 --> 17:30.724
Hey, SpongeBob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

17:30.827 --> 17:32.241
Yes, Patrick?
是的，帕特里克？

17:32.344 --> 17:36.172
I never thought being a parent
could be this much fun.
我从未想过成为父母
原来可以这么有趣。

17:36.275 --> 17:36.965
Me neither.
我也不。

17:37.068 --> 17:38.793
Well, good night, SpongeBob.
好吧，晚安，海绵宝宝。

17:38.896 --> 17:40.965
Good night, Patrick.
晚安，帕特里克。

17:41.862 --> 17:44.586
Patrick, breakfast is ready!
帕特里克，早餐准备好了！

17:46.482 --> 17:47.793
All right!
好的！

17:47.896 --> 17:51.275
All this parenting stuff
makes me hungry.
所有这些育儿的东西
让我饿了。

17:54.965 --> 17:58.310
Hey, Junior,
how you doing today?
嘿，少年，
你今天怎么样？

17:59.379 --> 18:00.379
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

18:00.448 --> 18:01.827
Yes, Patrick?
是的，帕特里克？

18:01.931 --> 18:02.931
Kid's got a stinky.
孩子身上有臭味。

18:03.034 --> 18:04.413
Could you change him?
你能改变他吗？

18:04.517 --> 18:05.517
My hands are full.
我的手已经满了。

18:07.206 --> 18:08.103
Ahh...
啊...

18:08.206 --> 18:09.596
Wish I could,
but I got to get going.
但愿我可以，
但我得走了。

18:09.620 --> 18:11.655
Going? Where are you going?
去？你要去哪里？

18:11.758 --> 18:12.655
Going to work.
要去上班了。

18:12.758 --> 18:14.172
I'm the dad, remember?
我是爸爸，记得吗？

18:14.275 --> 18:16.965
You mean I have to do
all this baby stuff myself?
你的意思是我必须做
这些婴儿用品都是我自己做的吗？

18:17.068 --> 18:19.931
I'll give you a break tonight
when I get home.
今晚我会让你休息一下
当我回到家时。

18:20.034 --> 18:22.551
Don't you two stop
being adorable.
你们两个别停下来吗
很可爱。

18:24.827 --> 18:25.965
Okay.
好的。

18:32.551 --> 18:34.448
Phew! What a day.
唷！多么美好的一天啊。

18:34.551 --> 18:35.758
Oh, great, you're home.
哦，太好了，你回来了。

18:35.862 --> 18:38.000
Now you can help me
with the baby.
现在你可以帮助我
和宝宝一起。

18:38.103 --> 18:40.103
Aw, gee, SpongeBob, I'd love to,
噢，天啊，海绵宝宝，我很乐意，

18:40.206 --> 18:42.482
but I'm totally beat from work.
但我完全被工作压垮了。

18:42.586 --> 18:43.586
Huh?
啊？

18:49.586 --> 18:52.000
That guy got hit in the head
with a coconut!
那家伙的头被击中了
和一个椰子！

18:52.103 --> 18:54.413
Patrick, what about my break?
帕特里克，我的休息时间怎么样？

18:54.517 --> 18:55.793
Oh, yeah, your break.
哦，是的，你休息一下。

18:55.896 --> 18:57.517
Uh, tomorrow, I promise.
呃，明天，我保证。

18:57.620 --> 19:00.724
Uh, okay, tomorrow.
呃，好吧，明天。

19:03.103 --> 19:04.862
Phew, another tough day.
唷，又是艰难的一天。

19:04.965 --> 19:09.965
Oh, Patrick, I'm so glad you're
home after working all day.
哦，帕特里克，我很高兴你
工作一整天后回家。

19:10.068 --> 19:12.413
I can't wait for my break.
我等不及休息了。

19:12.517 --> 19:13.862
Work was a killer.
工作是一个杀手。

19:13.965 --> 19:15.517
I need my chair.
我需要我的椅子。

19:16.482 --> 19:18.379
Patrick, I really need my...
帕特里克，我真的需要我的...

19:18.482 --> 19:20.206
Tomorrow for sure.
明天肯定。

19:22.275 --> 19:24.931
Patrick?
帕特里克？

19:25.034 --> 19:27.379
I'll get to it eventually...
我最终会做到的...

19:32.655 --> 19:34.482
Uh...?
呃……？

19:34.586 --> 19:35.586
Uh.
呃。

19:37.275 --> 19:38.931
Patrick Star, we need to talk!
帕特里克·斯塔，我们需要谈谈！

19:39.034 --> 19:40.724
Just one more minute...
I got to...
再过一分钟...
我必须...

19:40.827 --> 19:42.931
Don't "one more minute"
me, Mr. Man!
不要“再等一分钟”
我，曼先生！

19:43.034 --> 19:44.172
Hey! I'm missing
the coconut.
嘿！我失踪了
椰子。

19:44.275 --> 19:46.896
You haven't been
helping at all
with Junior!
你还没有去过
完全有帮助
与少年！

19:47.000 --> 19:48.000
We made a commitment
我们做出了承诺

19:48.034 --> 19:49.827
and you're not doing your share!
而你却没有尽自己的一份力！

19:49.931 --> 19:51.000
You never do anything.
你从来不做任何事情。

19:51.103 --> 19:52.586
I changed his diaper.
我给他换了尿布。

19:52.689 --> 19:53.724
Yeah, once.
是的，一次。

19:53.827 --> 19:55.000
He's only this big.
他只有这么大。

19:55.103 --> 19:58.379
How many diapers
can he possibly use?
纸尿裤有多少张
他可能会使用吗？

19:58.482 --> 19:59.551
Hmm?
唔？

19:59.655 --> 20:01.344
Oh, that's not so much.
哦，那不是那么多。

20:01.448 --> 20:02.896
Hmm?
唔？

20:03.000 --> 20:04.137
So?
所以？

20:04.241 --> 20:05.689
Hmm?
唔？

20:05.793 --> 20:07.413
Hmm?
唔？

20:07.517 --> 20:09.379
Hmm?
唔？

20:14.689 --> 20:16.275
I had no idea!
我不知道！

20:16.379 --> 20:19.793
What kind of father am I?
我是一个什么样的父亲？

20:21.827 --> 20:24.586
I'll make it up to you, buddy.
我会补偿你的，伙计。

20:24.689 --> 20:25.689
I promise.
我保证。

20:25.758 --> 20:28.827
So, what's the plan for today?
那么，今天有什么计划呢？

20:28.931 --> 20:30.241
No more fooling around.
别再胡闹了。

20:30.344 --> 20:31.793
From now on, I'm Superdad!
从现在开始，我就是超级爸爸！

20:31.896 --> 20:36.206
I'll work straight through lunch
so I can get home on time.
我会直接工作到吃午饭
这样我就能准时回家。

20:36.310 --> 20:39.793
So make sure you save
a big old stinky diaper
所以一定要保存
一个又大又臭的旧尿布

20:40.068 --> 20:41.068
for me to change.
为我改变。

20:41.172 --> 20:43.620
And you could take
the night off, pal.
你可以采取
晚上休息，朋友。

20:43.724 --> 20:45.896
