21:03.068 --> 21:05.000
Boy, that was some party!
天哪，那是一场聚会！

21:05.103 --> 21:06.586
Oh, hey, SpongeBob.
哦，嘿，海绵宝宝。

21:06.689 --> 21:07.689
Hey, Junior.
嘿，少年。

21:09.448 --> 21:10.482
What?
什么？

21:10.586 --> 21:11.448
What?!
什么？！

21:11.551 --> 21:12.620
Oh, nothing.
哦，没什么。

21:12.724 --> 21:13.965
Oh, what a relief.
哦，真是一种解脱。

21:14.068 --> 21:15.527
For a second,
I thought you
were mad at me.
一瞬间，
我以为你
他们生我的气。

21:15.551 --> 21:18.206
Do you remember
what you said to me
this morning?
你还记得吗
你对我说的话
今天早上？

21:18.310 --> 21:20.103
Something about
root beer, right?
一些关于
根汁啤酒，对吗？

21:21.793 --> 21:22.586
No.
不。

21:22.689 --> 21:23.517
Wait, wait.
等等，等等。

21:23.620 --> 21:24.620
Let me guess.
让我猜一下。

21:24.655 --> 21:25.965
I give up.
我放弃。

21:26.068 --> 21:28.482
Does "You could take
the night off, pal"
是否“你可以采取
晚上休息吧，朋友”

21:28.586 --> 21:29.655
ring a bell?
响铃吗？

21:29.758 --> 21:32.206
Pfft... I don't need this!
噗……我不需要这个！

21:32.310 --> 21:33.310
What?!
什么？！

21:33.344 --> 21:35.241
Where do you think you're going?
你认为你要去哪里？

21:35.344 --> 21:39.000
I'm going back to work.
我要回去工作了。

21:39.827 --> 21:41.000
Work?!
工作？！

21:46.931 --> 21:49.034
He got hit in the head
with two coconuts!
他头部被击中
有两个椰子！

21:49.137 --> 21:50.965
So... this is work?
那么……这是工作吗？

21:51.068 --> 21:53.482
You know, it's not
as easy as it looks.
你知道，这不是
就像看起来一样简单。

21:53.586 --> 21:56.068
Sometimes I got
to move the antenna,
有时我得到
移动天线，

21:56.172 --> 21:58.034
sometimes I lose the remote,
有时我会丢失遥控器

21:58.137 --> 22:00.862
and sometimes my butt
itches real bad!
有时我的屁股
真的很痒！

22:00.965 --> 22:02.241
Oh, you poor, poor thing.
哦，你这个可怜的东西。

22:02.344 --> 22:05.689
By the way, you forgot
your briefcase.
顺便说一句，你忘了
你的公文包。

22:08.655 --> 22:14.551
Oh, so this is the thanks I get
for working overtime?
哦，这就是我得到的感谢
为了加班？

22:15.206 --> 22:16.206
Overtime?!
随着时间的推移？！

22:27.448 --> 22:30.448
There's that stupid noise again!
那愚蠢的声音又来了！

22:30.551 --> 22:32.103
Oh, that's not a stupid noise.
哦，那不是愚蠢的声音。

22:32.206 --> 22:35.241
That's just Junior
about to jump out
that window.
这只是少年
即将跳出
那个窗户。

22:35.344 --> 22:36.827
Oh.
哦。

22:37.275 --> 22:39.793
Junior!
初级！

22:40.896 --> 22:41.689
Here, darling!
在这里，亲爱的！

22:41.793 --> 22:42.896
Here we come, buddy!
我们来了，伙计！

22:43.000 --> 22:45.344
Come to Daddy,
right in the
old pocket.
来到爸爸身边，
就在
旧口袋。

22:45.448 --> 22:47.551
Uh-oh!
呃-哦！

22:50.551 --> 22:51.965
Did you catch him?
你抓住他了吗？

22:52.068 --> 22:53.793
No.
不。

22:54.103 --> 22:57.793
We're bad parents.
我们是坏父母。

23:01.689 --> 23:03.206
Cheep-cheep-cheep.
吱吱吱。

23:03.310 --> 23:06.448
Cheep-cheep-cheep-cheep-cheep.
吱吱吱吱。

23:06.551 --> 23:07.620
Junior?
初级？

23:07.724 --> 23:09.137
He's flying.
他在飞。

23:09.241 --> 23:13.206
I guess he's all grown up.
我想他已经长大了。

23:15.068 --> 23:17.862
Hey, what about Daddy?
嘿，爸爸呢？

23:20.862 --> 23:23.103
That's my boy.
那是我的男孩。

23:23.206 --> 23:24.206
Good-bye.
再见。

23:24.275 --> 23:25.724
Good-bye, Junior.
再见，少年。

23:25.827 --> 23:28.827
Well, Patrick,
he doesn't need
us anymore.
好吧，帕特里克，
他不需要
我们不再了。

23:28.931 --> 23:33.379
This is the hardest part
of every parent's life...
这是最难的部分
每个父母的生活...

23:33.482 --> 23:34.758
I assume.
我认为。

23:34.862 --> 23:39.000
Despite all we've
been through,
it was worth it.
尽管我们已经
经历过，
这是值得的。

23:39.103 --> 23:40.103
Yeah.
是的。

23:40.137 --> 23:47.448
Let's have another.
我们再来一杯吧。

23:47.551 --> 23:50.827
And NICKELODEON
还有尼克罗迪恩

